WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:07,700
This time we have some good stuff. Let’s go.

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:12,900
Let's go look for it again and see where we go.

3
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:15,070
Find some more clues

4
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,270
But this is the only door here

5
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,270
What if you get lost later and can't be found?

6
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,070
There was no door or lock by then.

7
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:22,270
tear clothes to pieces

8
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:24,670
Mark a rag in the corner every few meters

9
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,070
Yellow walls only match dark fabric strips

10
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,870
You can see it from dozens of meters away

11
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:42,290
Nothing useful here

12
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,890
Might as well go back to that room and take a look
